298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 247 0 R
/E (HPE Private Cloud AI \(PCAI\) is deployed on HPE hardware through automated factory build workflows involving servers, storage, networking, OS, iLO, NFS, MinIO, and software stack configuration. Since these workflows contain many dependent tasks, errors can occur due to wrong software versions, last-minute stack changes, incorrect configuration procedures, or incomplete execution of earlier steps.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 247 0 R
/E (When such failures happen, engineers must manually analyze logs, identify the root cause, fix the issue, and either resume the workflow or restart it from the beginning. This manual recovery process is time-consuming and inconsistent.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
300 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 247 0 R
/E (This project aims to build an AI-enabled infrastructure deployment workflow using Airflow with LLM/RAG-based remediation. The system executes deployment tasks, understand errors and warnings, pinpoint failure causes, apply fixes, resume execution, and complete the workflow automatically.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
