/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 270 0 R
/E (This DAG automates OS provisioning using Apache Airflow, QEMU, and Libvirt. It installs virtualization tools, downloads an Alpine Linux image, provisions a virtual machine, validates its execution, and performs cleanup. An intentional AppArmor security policy violation is injected during VM provisioning. The generated failure logs are analyzed by a RAG-powered multi-agent framework, which identifies the root cause, applies the appropriate remediation, validates the fix, and automatically re-executes the workflow)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [4]
